msgid ""
"draft: still building the batch, members can be added or removed. confirmed:"
" locked from member edits, ready to post. posted: every member payment has "
"been posted; cash has moved. cancelled: terminal, members released back to "
"the open pool."
msgstr ""
"draft: de batch wordt nog opgebouwd, leden kunnen worden toegevoegd of "
"verwijderd. confirmed: vergrendeld voor ledenwijzigingen, klaar om te "
"boeken. posted: elke ledenbetaling is geboekt; het geld is verplaatst. "
"cancelled: definitief, leden worden vrijgegeven naar de open pool."

